%% section: Deep dives
flowchart TB
    A["Message sent"] --> B["Persist with a per-conversation sequence number"]
    B --> C{"Is the recipient connected?"}
    C -->|"Yes"| D["Publish to the gateway holding that socket"]
    C -->|"No"| E["Leave it stored, send a push notification"]
    D --> F{"Did the client ack?"}
    F -->|"No"| E
    E --> G["Client reconnects"]
    G --> H["Asks for everything after its last sequence number"]
    H --> I["Gap-free ordering without the server tracking per-device state"]
